Package: TmCalculatorShiny
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Interface for Nucleic-Acid Melting-Temperature Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Junhui", "Li", email = "ljh.biostat@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3973-1700")),
    person("Lihua Julie", "Zhu", role = "aut"))
Description: An interactive Shiny application built on top of the TmCalculator
    package. Provides a graphical front end for calculating nucleic-acid
    melting temperatures from pasted sequences, genomic coordinates, FASTA
    uploads, or genome-wide tiling of a BSgenome package; for comparing Tm
    across user-defined groups; and for visualising results, including
    multi-omics feature integration and multi-track genome plots.
